    "<b class=\"text-danger\">Note</b>: Please introduce yourself about your ability in competitions. Don't forget to mark the type if you choose other.": "<b class=\"text-danger\">注意</b>: 请简述你在以往比赛中担任过哪些职务，或你在比赛中擅长的工作类型。选择其他请务必备注想担当的职位（如场控）。",
    "<b>Warning:</b> Once you cancel your registration, you will <b>NOT</b> be a competitor and you cannot register for this competition any longer.": "<b>警告：</b>一旦退赛，你将失去本次比赛的参赛资格，并<b>无法</b>再次报名该比赛。",
